+	select FB_SYSMEM_HELPERS
+	help
+	  A framebuffer for UML guests whose changed pixels are mirrored
+	  into a host file or descriptor, where host-side viewers --
+	  tools/um-arm64/umview on Linux (X11 and Wayland sessions alike),
+	  the console app on Android -- pick them up.  The guest sees an
